---

## Conclusion

While the accidental leak of teaser graphics presented challenges, it also provided valuable insights into customer sentiment and engagement. By addressing the root causes and implementing the recommendations outlined in this report, we can minimize the risk of similar incidents in the future and strengthen our operational resilience.

